 "final_passage": "Across the six-dataset tabular benchmark suite, Ferrule achieved a higher mean test AUROC than Arbor-GBT on five of the six datasets, with the largest margin on Brook-Retention (90.2 vs. 89.0) and the only exception on Ivel-Fraud (92.3 vs. 92.8). Ferrule also outperformed logistic regression on all six datasets, with margins ranging from 3.1 points (Pemberly-Claims) to 4.4 points (Molton-Churn). However, no statistical tests were reported, so the observed differences cannot be claimed as statistically significant or reliable.",
